    → DuckDB glob s3://nba-api-mt/player_game_logs/{season}/*.csv                                                                           
    → filter PLAYER_NAME (fuzzy match on normalized)                                                                                        
    → print table: DATE | MIN | REB | FGA | FG3A | TEAM                                                                                     
    → print summary: n_games, date_range, n_null_fg3a, n_zero_fg3a                                                                          
                                                                                                                                            
